  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Consists of 15 leaves of varying texture, color and size housed in a clam shell box covered with black Japanese book cloth.  Each sheet was letterpress printed by the artist using Twin Rocker, Fabriano, Gutenberg, Roma, Rosapina, Cave, Hahnemule, Zerkall, Niddegan, Velata, BFK Rives, Johannot, and Somerset papers. Each leaf contains a promise. Holes have been punched through each one using a Japanese hole driller and the leftover punches are stored in a sealed packet at the bottom of the box.</subfield>
  </datafield>
